      metadataTitle: "JSON Size & Memory Analyzer Online",
      description: "Analyze JSON payload byte size, nesting depth, object distribution, array length, and minification savings in real-time.",
      longDescription: "Inspect JSON payload byte size, UTF-8 byte length, minification savings, maximum nesting depth, object and array distribution, and null-field density to diagnose bloated API responses and memory overhead.",
