        "Set the chunk size by maximum item count (for example, 25 for DynamoDB or 100 for Stripe/HubSpot batches) or maximum byte budget per chunk.",
        "Preview each batch's element count and payload weight, then copy individual chunks or download all slices as numbered files.",
