            "Percent-encode every '#' as %23 (e.g., fill='%23ff0000') because an unescaped '#' is treated as a URL fragment delimiter that truncates the SVG.",
            "Convert double quotes inside SVG attributes to single quotes (') and wrap the outer CSS url(\"...\") in double quotes to keep escaping minimal.",
            "Provide a viewBox attribute so background-size: contain/cover and mask-size: contain scale cleanly at any pixel density.",
