        "Enter your target metric name, job label selector, evaluation interval, and threshold.",
        "Review the generated record: naming convention and alert: for:/labels/annotations YAML block.",
        "Save the YAML into your Prometheus rules directory and validate syntax with promtool check rules rules.yml.",
