            "The key requirement is setting req_extensions = req_ext under [req] (or v3_req) and listing numbered DNS.1, DNS.2, IP.1 entries inside an [alt_names] block so OpenSSL embeds OID 2.5.29.17 into the CSR's extensionRequest attribute.",
