      longDescription: "Generate strictly typed TypeScript `fetch()` API client functions and request/response interfaces from OpenAPI 3.0/3.1 or Swagger 2.0 JSON/YAML specifications. Resolves `$ref` component schemas, path parameters, query objects, and JSON bodies cleanly.",
