            "JSON type \"string\" maps to string (or google.protobuf.Timestamp for format \"date-time\"), \"boolean\" maps to bool, \"number\" maps to double, and \"integer\" maps to int32 or int64.",
            "Every proto3 enum requires a zero-valued first entry; the generator automatically prepends an _UNSPECIFIED = 0 sentinel when the JSON enum lacks an explicit default.",
