            "Rendering dozens of pages simultaneously at 3x or 4x scale consumes significant canvas memory; export multi-page manuals in smaller page ranges if needed.",
            "Transparent PDF backgrounds export cleanly as alpha-channel PNGs or flatten onto a solid white canvas when exporting to JPEG.",
