            "Raw JSON bodies with JSON comments or trailing newlines are serialized safely inside single-quoted shell strings (escaping embedded single quotes as '\\'').",
            "GraphQL request bodies (body.mode === \"graphql\") serialize into standard JSON POST payloads containing { query, variables }.",
