            "Conversely, minifying strips # comments and collapses redundant whitespace and commas between fields (since commas are optional insignificant punctuation in GraphQL) without altering variable names, string literals, or field aliases, shrinking large queries sent over HTTP GET URL parameters or JSON bodies.",
